.max-w-md.mx-auto.mt-8
  h1.text-2xl.font-bold.mb-6.text-center Account Recovery / Login

  .mt-8.text-sm.text-gray-600.text-center
    | Enter a valid user key to log into an existing account.
  .mt-8.text-sm.text-gray-600.text-center
    | The currently logged in user on this device will be 
    span.font-bold logged out
    | , and the only way to log that user in again in is with that user's key.
  .mt-8.text-sm.text-gray-600.text-center
    | Be careful!
  = form_with(url: recover_user_path, method: :post, class: "space-y-6") do |f|
    .field
      = f.label :key, "Enter your user key:", class: "block text-gray-700 text-sm font-bold mb-2"
      = f.text_field :key, class: "shadow appearance-none border rounded w-full py-2 px-3 text-gray-700 leading-tight focus:outline-none focus:shadow-outline"
      
    .flex.items-center.justify-center
      = f.submit "Login", class: "bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded focus:outline-none focus:shadow-outline"
